WEBVTT

00:11:28.133 --> 00:11:30.823
"You know, that partner thing
you maybe were hoping for?

00:11:30.847 --> 00:11:32.601
That's probably not in your future."

00:11:32.625 --> 00:11:34.732
Because you quit after you were told that.

00:11:34.756 --> 00:11:36.623
Like, you quit pretty soon after that.

00:11:36.647 --> 00:11:38.413
SC: Oh -- about three hours later.

00:11:38.437 --> 00:11:39.446
(Laughter)

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:43.974
SC: Yeah! I mean, because actually,
I had been sort of chafing at it

00:11:43.998 --> 00:11:46.742
for the last two or three years
that I was practicing,

00:11:46.766 --> 00:11:51.049
and so it was like,
the moment that that happened,

00:11:51.073 --> 00:11:53.197
I felt suddenly set free.

00:11:53.861 --> 00:11:55.987
So the whole time
I had been practicing law,

00:11:56.011 --> 00:11:59.031
I had completely
forgotten -- completely --

00:11:59.055 --> 00:12:01.668
about the fact that
I had wanted to be a writer.